    "text": "Three numbers are in an increasing geometric progression with common ratio <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the middle number is doubled, then the new numbers are in an arithmetic progression with common difference <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;If the fourth term of GP is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>,</mo></math>&nbsp;then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>d</mi></math> is equal to :",
